  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Assisting Mozambique to strengthen criminal justice responses to terrorism, including capacities for collecting, preserving and sharing of evidence in line with human rights standards</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;To support Mozambican criminal justice authorities to demonstrably increase their knowledge, skills and institutional capacity to bring terrorists to justice in an accountable, transparent, rule-of-law and human rights-compliant manner, preventing the further escalation of the violence&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
